    <p class="note" id="noteMats" hidden>Each job's construction type sets its phases, which stretch to fit the job's construction length, and which materials are needed at which phase. An item's order-by date is the date it's needed on site, minus its lead time, minus the buffer. Until a product is picked, the long end of the lead time is used. Click any row to open that job's materials.</p>
