    <p class="note" id="noteSched" hidden>Jobs in design are scheduled backward from their production start using the standard steps below, so the design kickoff date is worked out for you. Steps marked "alongside previous" start at the same time as the step before them. Construction uses each job's own duration. Active jobs show construction only, from the as-of date through the months remaining. In the By department view, bars turn orange when a department has two jobs going at once and red at three or more.</p>
